  "content": {
    "id": "p17-q5-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "5",
    "prompt": "In $\\triangle ABC$, $A=71^\\circ$, $a=18\\text{ cm}$ and $b=14\\text{ cm}$. Find, correct to two decimal places:",
    "layout": "grid",
    "columns": 3,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p17-q5-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "$B$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$B\\approx47.34^\\circ$",
          "worked": "Apply the sine rule and take reciprocals:\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{18}{\\sin71^\\circ}&=\\frac{14}{\\sin B}\\\\\\frac{\\sin B}{14}&=\\frac{\\sin71^\\circ}{18}\\\\\\sin B&=\\frac{14\\sin71^\\circ}{18}\\\\B&=\\sin^{-1}\\left(\\frac{14\\sin71^\\circ}{18}\\right)\\\\B&\\approx47.34^\\circ.\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 49
      },
      {
        "id": "p17-q5-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$C$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$C\\approx61.66^\\circ$",
          "worked": "The angles of a triangle sum to $180^\\circ$. Retain the unrounded value of $B$:\n$$\\begin{align*}C&=180^\\circ-71^\\circ-B\\\\C&\\approx61.66^\\circ.\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 24
      },
      {
        "id": "p17-q5-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "$c$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$c\\approx16.76\\text{ cm}$",
          "worked": "Apply the sine rule using the unrounded value of $C$:\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{c}{\\sin C}&=\\frac{18}{\\sin71^\\circ}\\\\c&=\\frac{18\\sin C}{\\sin71^\\circ}\\\\c&\\approx16.76\\text{ cm}.\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 33
      }
    ]
